@page "/components/carousel"

<PageTitle>Carousel — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Carousel</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    CSS scroll-snap. Embla exists because Safari's implementation was unusable in 2019; it is fine
    now, so with scripting off this still swipes and still scrolls, and only the arrows go
    quiet — they hide rather than sit there dead.
</p>
<p class="doc-note">
    There is no API, no events and no plugins, because there is no library: what would have been
    <code>api.scrollNext()</code> is <code>scroller.scrollBy()</code>, and what would have been an
    <code>on("select")</code> handler is the <code>scroll</code> event.
</p>

