<h2 class="doc-h2">Spacing</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    A negative margin on the track and padding on each item, which is upstream's own trick: it
    keeps the first and last slides flush with the edges while the middle ones are spaced. Change
    both numbers together or the ends drift.
</p>
